Alembic migration environment.

Create the first domain migration after the authentication boundary is in place:

alembic revision --autogenerate -m "create initial domain tables"

Production safety convention:

- Domain tables created in the public schema must enable Row Level Security in the same migration.
- Do not create anon/authenticated policies unless the frontend intentionally starts using Supabase Data API.
- Do not use FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY; the backend and Alembic use direct database connections.
